  "description": "Reports server-side telemetry (CPU, memory, the live Wisej.NET session count, and custom metrics) to TestVibe. During a load test the metrics render in the load result next to the client-side numbers; while the project Dashboard is open they render in its real-time \"Live servers\" section. Register once in the static Program constructor with the TestVibe server URL and an API key — there is no idle traffic and telemetry is always best-effort.",
